  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "legend_0015_system_01",
      "hash64": "2ABC17BB8F9E8665",
      "text": "♪Rotom, tom...\\nRotom, tom...♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_01",
      "hash64": "357DB39716622F2B",
      "text": "Hola, hola... ¿[VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "357DB497166230DE",
      "text": "Te he hackeado el móvil para poder hablar\\ncontigo. No te importa, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "legend_0015_select_01",
      "hash64": "AECA47BE2224E1A2",
      "text": "¿Quién eres?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "legend_0015_select_02",
      "hash64": "AECA46BE2224DFEF",
      "text": "¿Que me has qué?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "357DB59716623291",
      "text": "Sí, a ver cómo te lo explico... Básicamente, he\\ntomado el control de tu móvil.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "357DB69716623444",
      "text": "Me llamo Casiopea.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "357DB797166235F7",
      "text": "He oído hablar de ti. Todo el mundo dice que\\neres un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a Entrenador[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a con mucho talento.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_06",
      "hash64": "357DB897166237AA",
      "text": "Si de verdad eres tan fuerte como todos dicen,\\nme gustaría pedirte un favor.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_07",
      "hash64": "357DB9971662395D",
      "text": "¿Conoces al Team Star?[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_14",
      "hash64": "35813C9716654DCD",
      "text": "No cuela. Sé que ya te has enfrentado a ellos.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_15",
      "hash64": "35813B9716654C1A",
      "text": "Mejor, así ya sabes de qué te hablo.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_08",
      "hash64": "357DAA9716621FE0",
      "text": "El Team Star es un grupo de gamberros formado\\npor alumnos de la academia.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_09",
      "hash64": "357DAB9716622193",
      "text": "Lo único que saben hacer es causar problemas\\ny crear malos rollos entre los estudiantes.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_10",
      "hash64": "3581389716654701",
      "text": "¡Y yo no pienso quedarme de brazos cruzados\\nmientras siguen haciendo de las suyas![VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_11",
      "hash64": "358137971665454E",
      "text": "He estado ideando un plan para hacerlos polvo\\ny conseguir que el grupo se disuelva...\\c\\n¡La Operación Stardust![VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_12",
      "hash64": "358136971665439B",
      "text": "La cosa es que para llevarlo a buen puerto\\nnecesito aliados, alguien capaz como tú.\\r\\n¿Te interesa?[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_13",
      "hash64": "35813597166541E8",
      "text": "No hace falta que te decidas ahora. Ya lo\\nhablaremos con más calma en otro momento.\\c\\nVenga, pues nada. Chao.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
